  "{date}: every rival crown has fallen or bowed. Your realm ({nation}) alone endures, ruling {n} provinces from the Caspian to the Tian Shan. Poets in Samarkand and Herat will sing of {ruler}.": "{date}: raqib tojlarning barchasi quladi yoki bosh egdi. Faqat sizning saltanatingiz ({nation}) qad tik turibdi va Kaspiydan Tyanshangacha {n} viloyatni boshqaradi. Samarqand va Hirot shoirlari {ruler} sharafiga qasidalar bitadi.",
