  "{name}'s request went unanswered. The amirs grumble that you are slow to act.": "{name}ning iltimosi javobsiz qoldi. Amirlar sizni ishga sust, deb noliydi.",
  "{name}, proud of his victories, demands the governorship of {city} as his reward.": "Gʻalabalaridan gʻururlangan {name} mukofot sifatida {city} hokimligini talab qilmoqda.",
